"Use memory write/forget with one fact of at most 1,000 characters, scope agent or user, and tier profile, log or note. Forget requires exact recorded text, the same scope, and no tier." = "請用 memory write/forget 處理單一事實（最多 1,000 字元），scope 為 agent 或 user，tier 為 profile、log 或 note。忘記時須使用記錄原文及相同 scope，不可指定 tier。";
"This saves the reply and images in this group. It does not add responders or automatically resend images to other models." = "這會將回覆與圖片儲存在此群組，不會新增回覆者或自動將圖片重送給其他模型。";
