"Only this agent's avatar changes. Names, private instructions, models and permissions stay unchanged. Reset restores Codex; no image files are deleted." = "只變更這位代理人的頭像，名稱、私人指令、模型與權限維持不變。重設會恢復 Codex，不會刪除任何圖片檔案。";
"For avatar changes, use target avatar with action set and a listed pet_id, or action clear without pet_id. Paths, URLs and other fields are not supported." = "變更頭像時，請使用 target avatar、action set 及清單中的 pet_id；或使用 action clear 且不提供 pet_id。不支援路徑、網址或其他欄位。";
